{"title":"2006 JBMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0ecf70e9e1af12c8ba1fd315b1e88e11679d44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is a composite number, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f5c51ea4b04b4992b003b39479f29018f6bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c680399c425113bf35cf459f6690f834aa62ac47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We shall prove a more stronger result that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b417a127620d5b467fe7a48ad5f7d843e5c390b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c680399c425113bf35cf459f6690f834aa62ac47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> for any composite number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0ecf70e9e1af12c8ba1fd315b1e88e11679d44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> which will cover the case of problem statement.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/a/aea78186f950990e96ef061b40627413ddf7c4f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = p.q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/1/eb11bb84cdb16f0e263f2e91c523ba09ea7045fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q \\ge p \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Let us define set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0726dac51cf91864d8ad7079c3acae73258fe34b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{1, 2, 3 ... n-1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/cce88a48fb7b28bced5d4b98f1acc96032563145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Case 1: q &gt; p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>First let's note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e803e2723d08dc4b08b7dd06018e88a1bf4e1106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Now, all multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c945c66c4c9fce708dddfc5e314ca95ff366d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1f49dadcc67420d40aea0a5eed89cabcc383e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.(q-1) \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf30efc17b322499a5bd7bd51e1e981668697014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q &gt; p =&gt; q &gt; 2 =&gt; q-1 \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"234\" height=\"15\" /> we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b47135ac4c83a5d0037a4e1d855b060d8770f45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.2 \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />\nAlso, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502f36a1624dcc3a77b595bad545b8cfb36c3498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a1825d22a1f0c4005679cb6fae18469d02cd4d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>So, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bce45ad60b7ea4e9dc40bd2b30a27873f5c088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, p.2, q \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />, \nin other words, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/a/94aad142c08d4621fda6d460c6704f5e8a085e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.p.q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c680399c425113bf35cf459f6690f834aa62ac47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f872918faa69901fffaf030ce395dd1db7e85a71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Case 2: q = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Now, all multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c945c66c4c9fce708dddfc5e314ca95ff366d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd36a84e50199b9e6a2665bc80ade35040da45b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.(p-1) \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f937b905e8ebb597f9eba52eb842073b0148f172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; 2 =&gt; p-1 \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"155\" height=\"15\" /> we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b47135ac4c83a5d0037a4e1d855b060d8770f45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.2 \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Also, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/e/31e9cd74c939fd1638c15d32b34e98087e768dda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = p^2 &gt; 4 =&gt; p &gt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"165\" height=\"18\" /> so we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a1825d22a1f0c4005679cb6fae18469d02cd4d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>So, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a67fc93359bd464347a8d0627cba5427bef0a13a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, p.1, p.2 \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, \nin other words, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cf2ff7e3b50df38ead315e280dc514164d75493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.p^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c680399c425113bf35cf459f6690f834aa62ac47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b417a127620d5b467fe7a48ad5f7d843e5c390b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c680399c425113bf35cf459f6690f834aa62ac47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~Kris17\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"JBMO\">JBMO</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017125122\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 178/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6094/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17030:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017125122 and revision id 244025. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}